===Speak with Firefly and bring the sightseeing to an end{{subst:void|<!--103030216-->}}===
{{Dialogue Start}}

;(Talk to Firefly)
:'''Firefly:''' Did you have fun, (Trailblazer)?
:'''Firefly:''' Penacony's Golden Hour is pretty amazing, isn't it?
:{{Диалог|Стрелка}} It's nice. Everywhere is just magical.
::'''Firefly:''' I know, right? It's a dream that's loving and forgiving to everyone, just like The Family.
::You sound a bit sad...?
